 Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 before submit; will not close until both land and the worktree is fast-forwarded past the merge.","timestamp":1785544679234908001}],"created_at":1785544433238089001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"ed09a80d-c601-4024-a10e-b3e81c42dbf9","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"5b01-add0-e970-44bd"}],"description":"## Why\nAGENTS.md is the canonical, cross-vendor agent guidance. CLAUDE.md bridges Claude Code to it\nvia an @AGENTS.md import, and .codex/config.toml points Codex's project_doc_fallback at it.\nGitHub Copilot's coding agent already reads AGENTS.md natively, but other Copilot surfaces\n(Copilot Chat, Copilot CLI) look at .github/copilot-instructions.md first and had no pointer\nback to AGENTS.md, so they could silently drift from the canonical guidance.\n\n## What\nAdd .github/copilot-instructions.md as a thin bridge file (mirroring CLAUDE.md's role): it\ndeclares AGENTS.md authoritative, summarizes the key sections (ticket workflow, Gerrit git\nflow, module-size policy, code-navigation tooling), and explicitly says not to duplicate\ncontent that could drift.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `.github/copilot-instructions.md` exists in the tracked tree and states that `AGENTS.md`\n      is canonical/authoritative for this repo.\n- [ ] The new file summarizes rather than restates `AGENTS.md` (ticket workflow, Gerrit git\n      flow, module-size policy, code-navigation tooling) and says `AGENTS.md` wins on conflict.\n- [ ] No local-only Copilot state is added to the tracked tree (mirrors the posture where\n      `CLAUDE.local.md` and `.codex/worktrees` stay untracked/local-only).\n- [ ] Change lands through Gerrit per CONTRIBUTING.md: commit carries a `rebar-ticket:` trailer\n      and DCO sign-off, pushed to `refs/for/main`, and reaches `LLM-Review +1` and `Verified +1`.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":".github/copilot-instructions.md","reason":"new bridge file pointing Copilot Chat/CLI at canonical AGENTS.md, mirroring CLAUDE.md"}],"keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"f5652cb3-f110-43b1-89e2-782ee63fa8be","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f1db-f250-e38b-4ffe","ticket_type":"task","title":"Add .github/copilot-instructions.md bridge file for provider-guidance parity","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["deff68df-c9ca-47c2-9310-5419acea223e","2b24e4b8-1788-486a-9817-b7c586fa1633","ed09a80d-c601-4024-a10e-b3e81c42dbf9","c4430372-6071-4295-868f-05a18729918e","567a8185-f0d7-4844-b43f-ca91c89e5f84","f5652cb3-f110-43b1-89e2-782ee63fa8be","3b15296e-b2b4-4cc2-9e1c-20ac744ef8c7","8052cf58-59a0-408b-bf28-3ea75b1111fe"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785544679234908002,"uuid":"bb24cc11-d341-4b4f-8f09-183d1df62e65"}